text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M00_Text_08180815 {
    "Hey, how’s it going, the CHAMPION-\nbound {PLAYER}?\pWATTSON, the LEADER of MAUVILLE\nGYM, uses ELECTRIC-type POKéMON.\pIf you challenge him with WATER-type\nPOKéMON, he’ll zap them! Bzzt!\pAnd, he’s put in switch-controlled doors\nall over his GYM! Eccentric!\pHey, go for it!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M00_Text_0818091D {
    "Whoa, you’re electrifying!\nYou’ve powered the door open!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M00_Text_08180956 {
    "My electric soul, it’ll shatter your\ndreams whole, whoah-yeahah!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M00_Text_08180997 {
    "That was plugged in, amped up,\nover-driven electric, man!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M00_Text_081809D1 {
    "POKéMON and rock, it’s all about heart,\nwhoah yeah!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M00_Text_08180A05 {
    "I trained under WATTSON!\nThere ain’t no way I’d lose easily!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M00_Text_08180A42 {
    "Unplugged and turned off..."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M00_Text_08180A5E {
    "WATTSON, our GYM LEADER, has been\naround for a long, long time.\pHe was battling even before your\ndaddy was born, that tough coot."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M00_Text_08180AE0 {
    "This GYM’s got puzzles!\nIsn’t it fun?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M00_Text_08180B06 {
    "It’s no fun to lose..."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M00_Text_08180B1D {
    "WATTSON says he likes setting up\nlittle traps with switches."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M00_Text_08180B5A {
    "With my charm and my POKéMON’s moves,\nyou’ll be shocked!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M00_Text_08180B93 {
    "I’m shocked by your power!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M00_Text_08180BAE {
    "I’ve heard that MAUVILLE was founded\nby WATTSON.\pHe was a TRAINER long before we\nbecame TRAINERS.\lHe must know all sorts of things!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M00_Text_08180F4A {
    "MAUVILLE CITY POKéMON GYM"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M00_Text_08180F64 {
    "MAUVILLE CITY POKéMON GYM\pWATTSON’S CERTIFIED TRAINERS:\n{PLAYER}"
}
